    "description": "Storage Grip V2 (3DP PCC): Laffs Dynamics\n\nThe original Laffs Dynamics Storage Grip V2, adapted to work with 3D printed pistol caliber carbines.\n\nMounts to:\n\n * MOD-9 Platform\n * WTF-9\n * FGC-9 Platform\n * Partisan-9\n * Shuty AP9\n * KC9\n\n\n\nHas two different textured locking tab hatches. \n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 220C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 7+\nInfill: 32%\nSupport Material Percentage: 18% \n\n\n\nHardware Needed:\n\n1x Allen Head Screw, 1/4-28 x 1\"\n\n1x Steel Star Washer\n\n1x Safety Selector Detent Pin\n\n1x Safety Selector Detent Spring\n\n1x M3x12mm (or M3x15mm) Hex Set Screw\n\n\n\nNotes: \n\n1) Storage Grip V2 can hold roughly a little over half a standard pack of Skittles.\n\n2) The original Storage Grip V2 can be found here: https://defcad.com/library/b105b346-b4b4-4d46-952c-b84063624573/",
